# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Anything local-only or machine-specific belongs here, never tracked --
# this repo is deliberately free of secrets, tokens and paths that differ
# per machine (DIOR_BOT_DIR in core.zsh is the single exception, and it is
# a plain filesystem path, not a credential).
local.zsh
*.local.zsh

# Ephemeral working notes -- handoffs, plans, scratch. These describe intent for
# work not yet done, so they are wrong the moment it ships; they must never enter
# tracked history. Durable decisions belong in CLAUDE.md, code comments, or memory.
local/
